@@ -0,0 +1,85 @@
+// This file is part of a Java port of RE2 (https://github.com/google/re2).
+// Original RE2 code is Copyright (c) 2009 The RE2 Authors.
+// Modifications and Java port Copyright (c) 2026 Eddie Aftandilian.
